 784:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   For devices with several ADCs: reset of ADC common registers is done 
 785:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         only if all ADCs sharing the same common group are disabled.
