1527:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Wait for regular group conversion to be completed.
1528:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   ADC conversion flags EOS (end of sequence) and EOC (end of
1529:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         conversion) are cleared by this function, with an exception:
1530:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         if low power feature "LowPowerAutoWait" is enabled, flags are 
1531:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         not cleared to not interfere with this feature until data register
1532:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         is read using function HAL_ADC_GetValue().
1533:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   This function cannot be used in a particular setup: ADC configured 
1534:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         in DMA mode and polling for end of each conversion (ADC init
1535:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         parameter "EOCSelection" set to ADC_EOC_SINGLE_CONV).
1536:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         In this case, DMA resets the flag EOC and polling cannot be
1537:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         performed on each conversion. Nevertheless, polling can still 
1538:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         be performed on the complete sequence (ADC init
