1745:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    with NbrOfConversion =1U), flag EOC is used to determine the           */
1746:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    conversion completion.                                                */
1747:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*  - If sequence conversion for regular group (scan mode enabled and       */
1748:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    NbrOfConversion >=2U), flag EOC is set only at the end of the          */
1749:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    sequence.                                                             */
1750:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    To poll for each conversion, the maximum conversion time is computed  */
1751:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    from ADC conversion time (selected sampling time + conversion time of */
1752:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    12.5 ADC clock cycles) and APB2/ADC clock prescalers (depending on    */
1753:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    settings, conversion time range can be from 28 to 32256 CPU cycles).  */
1754:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    As flag EOC is not set after each conversion, no timeout status can   */
1755:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   /*    be set.                                                               */
