4404:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Stop ADC group injected conversion (potential conversion on going
4405:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         on ADC group regular is not impacted), disable ADC peripheral
4406:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         if no conversion is on going on group regular.
4407:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         Interruptions disabled in this function:
4408:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *          - JEOC (end of conversion of injected group) and JEOS (end of 
4409:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *            sequence of injected group)
4410:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   To stop ADC conversion of both groups regular and injected and to
4411:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         to disable ADC peripheral, instead of using 2 functions
4412:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         @ref HAL_ADCEx_RegularStop() and @ref HAL_ADCEx_InjectedStop(),
4413:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         use function @ref HAL_ADC_Stop().
4414:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   If injected group mode auto-injection is enabled,
4415:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         function HAL_ADC_Stop must be used.
4416:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Case of multimode enabled (for devices with several ADCs): This 
4417:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         function must be called for ADC master first, then ADC slave.
4418:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         For ADC master, conversion is stopped and ADC is disabled. 
4419:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         For ADC slave, ADC is disabled only (conversion stop of ADC master
