4708:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         disable ADC DMA transfer, disable ADC peripheral
4709:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         if no conversion is on going on group injected.
