4716:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Multimode is kept enabled after this function. To disable multimode
4717:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         (set with HAL_ADCEx_MultiModeConfigChannel() ), ADC must be 
4718:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         reinitialized using HAL_ADC_Init() or HAL_ADC_ReInit().
