4720:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         HAL_ADC_Stop_DMA must be called after this function with handle of
4721:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         ADC slave, to properly disable the DMA channel of ADC slave.
4722:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @param  hadc ADC handle of ADC master (handle of ADC slave must not be used)
4723:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @retval None
