5271:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         @ref HAL_ADCEx_InjectedStop(), use function
5272:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         @ref HAL_ADCEx_MultiModeStop_DMA.
5273:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   In case of auto-injection mode, this function also stop conversion
5274:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         on ADC group injected.
